      "title": "Prevent null dereference in `rescan_file()`",
      "message": "Prevent null dereference in `rescan_file()`\n\nGiven that this check was not in the code before, I assume that it\n\"should be\" impossible for `frame_data_sequence_find()` to return NULL.\nAdding this check makes sure, and prevents a crash in the unlikely event\nthat it does happen.\n\nPartial fix for #17989\n",
